  "caveats": [
    "The prefix ends at the FIRST cancellation, which is what the Lean chain proves and is NOT a normal form. Running further is a different question and answering it does not answer this one -- that confusion is what the correction in the docstring records.",
    "Reaching an endpoint is necessary, not sufficient: a stretch that transfers still has to compose on the nose. Here it did -- both `prefixChain2` and `prefixChain1` are proved, lean-direct exit 0, axiom-clean -- so this caveat is discharged rather than outstanding. `oc` requires only j1 <= i1, i.e. a >= 1, so with a >= 3 already proved there is no uncovered corner left in this regime."
  ],
  "q0Anchor": "independent",
  "q0AnchorReason": "Grobner-Shirshov rewriting in the Hecke algebra over the FORMAL parameter h = q - q^-1 (a sympy Symbol). The reduction is combinatorial in the braid word and its coefficients are rational functions of that symbol; no substrate q0 is read anywhere in the import cone (verified: no qou_substrate constants import, no q_parameter / q_at / Q_50_DIGIT reference, in this file or in hecke_gs_confluence_n4.py which supplies the rule table)."
}
